The morphing method in zervo-core/src/morph.rs is a port of the approach
published by morphicons. That project is TypeScript and is not linked against
here; what was taken is its method — normalise to cubic Béziers, resample by
arc length, fit rotation and scale with 2D Procrustes, interpolate in polar
space — which its README and architecture notes set out.

    https://github.com/guillermolg00/morphicons

